<%- include("partials/head") %>
<%- include("partials/header") %>
<main>
<%- include("partials/phero", {
  crumbs: [["Home", "/"], [which === "privacy" ? "Privacy" : "Terms"]],
  h1: which === "privacy" ? "Privacy Policy" : "Terms and Conditions",
}) %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose" style="margin-inline:auto">
<%# Starting text. Have it reviewed before launch and edit this file. %>
<% if (which === "privacy") { %>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you send an enquiry through this website we receive the details you enter: your name, country, group size, the kind of trip you are interested in, your email address, your contact number and any message you add.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your enquiry and plan the trip you asked about.</li>
        <li>To keep a record of our correspondence with you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your details and we do not add you to a mailing list because you sent an enquiry.</p>

      <h2>Who sees it</h2>
      <p>Your enquiry is read by the XPITUDE planning team. It is stored with the companies that host this website and deliver our email, who handle it only on our behalf.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
      <p>This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies. The typefaces are loaded from Google Fonts, which means your browser contacts Google when a page loads.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it<% if (site.email) { %> by writing to <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a><% } else { %> through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a><% } %>.</p>
<% } else { %>
      <h2>Using this website</h2>
      <p>This website is published by XPITUDE, <%= site.address.street %>, <%= site.address.city %>, <%= site.address.country %>. The information on it is general guidance for planning a journey and may change without notice.</p>

      <h2>Enquiries and bookings</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sending an enquiry does not create a booking or an obligation on either side.</li>
        <li>Prices shown as "from" are guide prices per person. The price for your trip is confirmed in a written proposal.</li>
        <li>A booking is made only when you accept a written proposal from us. The booking conditions that apply to your trip, including payment and cancellation, are sent with that proposal.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Travel information</h2>
      <p>The Travel Guide is written to help you prepare. Visa rules, flight schedules, road conditions and government travel advice change, so please confirm anything that matters with the official source before you rely on it.</p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>The text, photographs and design of this website belong to XPITUDE or are used with permission, and may not be reproduced without our consent.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent<% if (site.email) { %> to <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a><% } else { %> through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a><% } %>.</p>
<% } %>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
